  id: help_contracts
  displayName: Contracts
  order: 180
  category: Basics
  icon: knowledge
  body: 'The contracts on the right are your goals: dig so many cells, bring in some ore, build a machine. The first ones walk you through the start, one at a time; later ones are drawn at random and ask for more each time.


    When a contract is done it turns gold: click Claim reward for knowledge, food and sometimes items. A new contract takes its place.'
